    "editorialIntent": "Peninsula This Weekend is an editorial planning piece, not an events roundup. Lead with the feeling, rhythm, or mood of the weekend before any recommendation. Curate selectively; no Skip or Avoid sections; no three-weekend-shapes buzz-bullets. Reader should finish thinking 'that sounds like a good Peninsula weekend', not 'that was a good article'. Tone: editorial, selective, useful, local, premium without luxurious, emotionally aware, calm, confident.",
